{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvTGFrc2htaSUyMCUyODIwMTQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Lakshmi","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2rM2sDBjaEVaeWMZ8Ka7n1WXOIn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mVmrmMhNCPNEukA50RzO78SEV95.jpg","description":"Based on true events, Lakshmi is a story of heroism and untold courage. Lakshmi, a 13 year old girl is kidnapped and sold into prostitution. Thrown into this horrific, inhuman world where she is raped and brutally beaten she barely survives with the help of the other girls and her own will to never give in. Finally she is rescued in a police raid. Against all odds, Lakshmi shows courage where everybody else fails. Resisting all pressure - violent threats, coercion and bribes, she stands up in court and in a landmark case in India, succeeds in putting the traffickers behind bars.\n\nRated UA · Released 21 Mar 2014 · India · Language: Hindi · 115 min\nStudio: SIC Productions, UV News Media & Communication, Kukunoor Movies\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","imdb_id":"tt2976176","moviedb_id":260267,"tmdbId":260267,"runtime":"115 min","cast":["Monali Thakur","Satish Kaushik","Ram Kapoor","Nagesh Kukunoor","Flora Saini","Shefali Shah","Vibha Chibber","Ranjeet Jha"],"director":["Nagesh Kukunoor"],"writer":["Nagesh Kukunoor"],"released":"2014-03-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Lakshmi is a story of hope, courage and victory!","country":"India","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nagesh Kukunoor","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/km7h1Dp2TLL1TlXZIype9rN1fjX.jpg"},{"name":"Monali Thakur","character":"Lakshmi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ocvlCGDbSyiSk6ubjELe6IWF1y6.jpg"},{"name":"Satish Kaushik","character":"Sr. Reddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lnqVTsUKVxJYPWN3KRBhRlGP1Z0.jpg"},{"name":"Ram Kapoor","character":"Advocate A